    "A quick test can skip lessons you already know." : {
      "comment" : "A lesson end's offer to take the quick test of what the learner knows",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mit einem kurzen Test kannst du Lektionen überspringen, die du schon kennst."
