    "Your plan and lessons follow only this material. We couldn't read “%@”." : {
      "comment" : "Under the learner's material on the goal card, when nothing could be read on one of their files. \"This material\" is what the row lists; {title} is the file it couldn't read, like \"Notes.jpg\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Plan und deine Lektionen richten sich nur nach diesem Material. „%@“ konnten wir nicht lesen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu plan y tus lecciones se basan solo en este material. No pudimos leer “%@”."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ton plan et tes leçons s’appuient uniquement sur ce contenu. Impossible de lire « %@ »."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il tuo piano e le lezioni si basano solo su questo materiale. Non siamo riusciti a leggere “%@”."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "学習計画とレッスンには、この資料だけが使われます。「%@」を読み取れませんでした。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "계획과 레슨은 이 자료만 바탕으로 만들어요. “%@” 파일은 읽을 수 없어요."
